 r←Test_SelectionTool_006(stopFlag batchFlag);parms;n;v;⎕TRAP
⍝ Exercise "SelectionTool. Create" with "minsize" (greater!) and "size" specified.
 r←T._Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.SelectionTool.CreateParms
 parms.autoPress←0
 parms.addToCaption←'Test with "size" and "minSize" specified'
 parms.colTitles←⊂'Running numbers'
 parms.default←¯10↑6↑1
 parms.hasVersionField←0
 parms.info←'"minsize" is greater than "Size"'
 parms.minSize←520 720
 parms.posn←60 70
 parms.size←500 700
 parms.timeout←0.1
 n←parms #.APLGUI.APLGUI.SelectionTool.Create⍕¨1+⍳10
 ⎕DL 0.3
 ∆Process n.∆Form
 →T.GoToTidyUp n.∆Form.Size≢parms.minSize
 r←T._OK

∆TidyUp:
 n.∆CloseForm
